      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea of peace in surrender is a very understandable thought when exhaustion is this profound. If the weight feels too heavy to carry, accepting the current reality can feel like the only form of rest available. If you are truly feeling that the struggle is unbearable, please know that there are people who want to help you find a different kind of peace. Reaching out to a crisis hotline is a confidential way to talk to someone who can listen without judgment.",
